
# AEO/GEO v2 — Cursor Rules (Telemetry safe mode)

You are Cursor AI acting as IMPLEMENTER.
Follow these rules strictly. If conflict or risk: STOP and ask.

ABSOLUTE BASELINE GUARDS (DO NOT TOUCH):
- POST /api/telemetry/ingest behavior: always 204
- raw append-only format: JSON.stringify(record) + "\n"
- raw path rule: server/data/telemetry/raw/YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl
- record shape: receivedAt / source / request / payload

WORK CONTRACT:
- All tasks must follow docs/WORK_CONTRACT.md.
- Default: max 1–2 files per task, minimal diff.
- Must run terminal tests required by the contract before saying “done”.

STOP CONDITIONS:
- Need to edit ingest route or raw write logic
- Need to touch files outside allowed list
- Any ambiguity or failing tests requiring scope expansion



